This project follows PRD_AUTH.md and AUTH_TODO.md as the source of truth.

Core rules:
- Authentication uses HTTP + JWT only. Do NOT use WebSocket for authentication.
- User approval is controlled only by users.status enum. There is NO isApproved field.
- Roles are strictly: ADMIN, MANAGER, USER.
- MANAGER can manage only users and data within the same organization_id.
- organization_number is UNIQUE and used only for signup, not for authorization.
- Follow AUTH_TODO.md order strictly.
- Implement one step at a time. Stop after completing each step and wait for confirmation.